  "article": [
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Xcode compares your app’s metrics against two types of goals: *similar-app goals*, which are based on metrics from apps with functional and technical similarities to yours, and *historical performance goals*, which are based on your app’s own historical data.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "When Xcode has enough information to determine a goal for a metric, it is available in this resource. Use this information to plan and prioritize performance-engineering work.",
          "refs": []
        }
